ut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span> themselves), you'd have nothing to talk about.</p>\n<p>I don't remember enough about Hopf algebras to answer your question either, but I'm trying to understand it. ☺️</p>","timestamp":1496252502,"subject":"Hopf crossed module","stream_id":16,"display_recipient":"Preprints & Publications","reactions":[]}]